Provenance of third-party code in the Vulkan forwarding layer
(runtime/gpuapi/vk)

bcdec.c   the BC1 to BC7 block decoders, ported from bcdec,
          https://github.com/iOrange/bcdec, v0.985, commit
          80859ed3b7afb1c527a2a99d70c61457bea72d0c, by Sergii Kudlai.
          bcdec is offered under the MIT license or the Unlicense; relift
          uses it under the MIT license (text below, also in the file).
          Changes: one C11 file, the signed and unsigned BC4/BC5 decoders
          of its BCDEC_BC4BC5_PRECISE configuration only, no float output
          variants, const tables, signed endpoints read as signed char.

